{"text": "OUTLINE\nHC/PM TECHNICAL DISCUSSIONS\nDecember 3, 1992\nPREVIOUS CONCLUSIONS AND PLANS\n\u00a2@ PROCEDURES AND DATA HANDLING.\n\n@ NEW DATA: POLYSTYRENE, GLASS SIZE, AND\nMICROCRYSTALLINE WAX.\n@ \"SPECTRA-LIKE\" COMPARISONS TO ACETATE OF:\nPOLYCARBONATE, POLYVINYLACETATE, POLYSTYRENE, GLASS\nSIZE (VEGETABLE OIL/STARCH), MICROCRYSTALLINE WAX.\n\n@ TEST METHOD CORRECTIONS/REFINEMENTS, INCLUDING PM\nCONCERNS:\n\n* ADDITION FUNNEL REDESIGN\n* FLOW RATES DURING TEST.\n* AFFECT OF PRESSURE DROPS ON CHEMICALS ABSORPTION.\n* AFFECT OF GLASS SIZE ON CHEMICAL ABSORPTION.\n* EVALUATION OF FIBERGLASS CLEANING PROCEDURES.\n* COMPARISON OF NITROGEN VERSUS AIR CARRIERS.\n\n* COMPARISON OF TEFLON SLEEVES/SILICONE GREASE.\n\nLGESHESSOS\n\n@ STATUS/CONCLUSIONS/PLANS\n\nHoechst Celanese Hoechst A",
